# EonlineBazar Cursor Rules
# Cursor AI must follow these when working on this project

1. Always read REFACTOR_MAP.md and ARCHITECTURE.md first
2. Never add styles to admin.css, profile.css, or style.css directly — use css/admin/*.css, css/profile/*.css, or css/global/*.css
3. Never add code to admin-core.js directly — use js/admin/modules/*.js
4. Never change function names or IDs without searching all files first
5. Backend routes in routes/*.js are sacred — never restructure
6. After any change, list which files were modified
